摘要中的主要功能必须被所选片段支持。优先把改变用途含义的条件写进摘要，不能只藏在limitations。遇到“阶段1骨架”“cloud provider待实现”“匿名thread后续实现”等，摘要明确当前仅本地草稿/审批落盘，不说已实现匿名网络或云端发布。Codex/模型登录适配归coding-development；Oopz等语音房的对话连接归communication-integrations。自述兼容或性能用“作者称/README注明”，不冒充本次验证。
格式示例（仅结构，不是来源事实）：evidence:[{"paragraph_id":"p3s1","fact":"该片段支持的中文转述"}]。请从本次真实输入挑选编号。","role":"system"},{"content":"{"metadata":{"description":"UI plugin for deepseek harness web","id":"gh:1343465288","install_available":true,"language":"TypeScript","name":"xiao-theme-dsh-ui-plugin","slug":"jinxlux/xiao-theme-dsh-ui-plugin","topics":["dsh","dsh-plugin","dsh-plugins","genshin","genshin-impact"]},"paragraphs":[{"id":"p1s1","text":"UI plugin for deepseek harness web"},{"id":"p2s1","text":"> **Language / 言語：** **English** (current) · 简体中文 · 日本語 · 한국어"},{"id":"p3s1","text":"# xiao-ui-theme-ts"},{"id":"p4s1","text":"> ✅ **Adapted to the latest DSH Desktop build (tested on `0.1.7-rc.2`) and the Web build (tested on "},{"id":"p4s2","text":"`0.1.5-rc.3`).** Any DSH `v0.1.5-alpha.1` or newer (a build that ships the official right panel) wor"},{"id":"p4s3","text":"ks; on anything older please use theme `0.11.x` — see Version compatibility."},{"id":"p5s1","text":"A **highly customizable theme plugin** for DeepSeek Harness (ships with a \"Xiao\" jade-green look by "},{"id":"p5s2","text":"default). It themes the DeepSeek Harness web UI: colors, mascot badge, background, and injected voic"},{"id":"p5s3","text":"e are all configurable. The background supports **static images, animated GIFs, and looping videos ("},{"id":"p5s4","text":"MP4/WebM/MOV/M4V)** — an uploaded animated GIF is auto-detected and used as a live/dynamic backgroun"},{"id":"p5s5","text":"d, and an uploaded video is auto-detected and played as a full-screen looping background. Out of the"},{"id":"p5s6","text":" box it's a Xiao-style jade/emerald theme, but the accent color, badge text, voice, and background a"},{"id":"p5s7","text":"re all tweakable — make it your own."},{"id":"p6s1","text":"## What is this"},{"id":"p7s1","text":"Gives the DeepSeek Harness web UI a heavily customizable theme. **By default it's the jade-green \"Xi"},{"id":"p7s2","text":"ao\" look** (jade palette + mascot badge + Xiao-style voice + frosted background), but every part is "},{"id":"p7s3","text":"adjustable: accent color, badge text, voice toggle/language/content, background image and transparen"},{"id":"p7s4","text":"cy. It also optionally injects a \"Xiao-style voice\" into the session — turn it on if you want the as"},{"id":"p7s5","text":"sistant to speak like Xiao, off if not. It only changes tone/style, never the substance of the answe"},{"id":"p7s6","text":"r. On top of that it ships a **separate roleplay space** (entertainment): an independent, tool-free "},{"id":"p7s7","text":"agent preset for actually chatting in character, kept deliberately apart from work sessions — a work"},{"id":"p7s8","text":" session only ever gets tone, never a character identity."},{"id":"p8s1","text":"## Preview"},{"id":"p9s1","text":"Desktop app (DSH Desktop, latest build)"},{"id":"p10s1","text":"Light mode"},{"id":"p11s1","text":"Dark mode"},{"id":"p12s1","text":"Switch to another theme"},{"id":"p13s1","text":"Settings page"},{"id":"p14s1","text":"Settings page (continued)"},{"id":"p15s1","text":"## Features"},{"id":"p16s1","text":"- **Customizable palette (jade/emerald by default)**: light / dark jade palettes; pick the accent wi"},{"id":"p16s2","text":"th a color wheel, and toggle the theme off from settings.\n- **Mascot badge**: a draggable, collapsib"},{"id":"p16s3","text":"le badge (bottom-right); title and subtitle can be set to any text, and the avatar image can be repl"},{"id":"p16s4","text":"aced by uploading a new one. The avatar also supports animated GIFs — an uploaded GIF plays as an an"},{"id":"p16s5","text":"imation with no separate toggle. A **Reset mascot** button restores the avatar path, title and subti"},{"id":"p16s6","text":"tle to their defaults. **With a video background the badge also shows a 🔊/🔇 button and a volume slid"},{"id":"p16s7","text":"er** (just left of the close button): click the speaker to mute/unmute, drag the slider to set the l"},{"id":"p16s8","text":"evel on the spot — they are the same fields as \"Background video audio / Background video volume\" on"},{"id":"p16s9","text":" the settings page and stay in sync. Static or GIF backgrounds never show these controls.\n- **Xiao-s"},{"id":"p16s10","text":"tyle voice (work sessions)**: injects a Xiao-voice instruction into the system prompt (toggleable), "},{"id":"p16s11","text":"with Chinese / English templates or your own custom prompt. **Tone only**: the substance, tools and "},{"id":"p16s12","text":"execution stay exactly the same, and no character identity is injected.\n[该节后续省略]"},{"id":"p17s1","text":"## Requirements"},{"id":"p18s1","text":"- DeepSeek Harness (`dsh` available) — with **`v0.1.5-alpha.1` or newer** (builds that ship the offi"},{"id":"p18s2","text":"cial right panel) **use this release or a later one**; on anything **before `v0.1.5-alpha.1`, use th"},{"id":"p18s3","text":"e previous release `0.11.x`** (see Version compatibility)\n- better-sidebar (optional third-party plu"},{"id":"p18s4","text":"gin) — **`0.19.x` only**; legacy `≤ 0.18` (self-drawn right panel) is not adapted to\n- Node.js (≥ 18"},{"id":"p18s5","text":" recommended)\n- pnpm"},{"id":"p19s1","text":"## Version compatibility"},{"id":"p20s1","text":"**Pick the theme version by your DSH version — the dividing line is whether the official right panel"},{"id":"p20s2","text":" exists (`dsh-client-ui-sidebar-right`, introduced in `v0.1.5-alpha.1`):**"},{"id":"p21s1","text":"| Your setup | Install | Notes |"},{"id":"p22s1","text":"| **DSH `v0.1.5-alpha.1` or newer** (ships the official right panel) | **this release `0.12.0` or la"},{"id":"p22s2","text":"ter (preferred)** | the painting model covers both shapes of the official right panel: the panel pai"},{"id":"p22s3","text":"nts itself (`v0.1.5-alpha.1` – `0.1.6-alpha.2`), or the panel paints nothing while inner surfaces do"},{"id":"p22s4","text":" (`0.1.7-alpha.1` and newer) |\n| **DSH before `v0.1.5-alpha.1`** (no official right panel) | **the p"},{"id":"p22s5","text":"revious release `0.11.x`** | that generation's right column and anchors do not line up with this rel"},{"id":"p22s6","text":"ease; the older theme is the safer pick |"},{"id":"p23s1","text":"> ⚠️ **Picking against the table will not crash**: the plugin still loads and DSH still starts, but "},{"id":"p23s2","text":"**UI bugs may appear** — for example the sidebar / right panel background and transparency can be wr"},{"id":"p23s3","text":"ong (too flat, not transparent enough, mismatched between the two sides, or showing the background t"},{"id":"p23s4","text":"hrough entirely).\n> - Official right panel (`v0.1.5-alpha.1` or newer) → this release or later.\n> - "},{"id":"p23s5","text":"Before `v0.1.5-alpha.1` → the previous release `0.11.x`.\n> - The legacy anchors (`data-dsh-panel` / "},{"id":"p23s6","text":"`data-dsh-pane`) are still in the CSS, so an old combination will not error or crash — only the **lo"},{"id":"p23s7","text":"ok is not guaranteed**."},{"id":"p24s1","text":"## Install online (quick)"},{"id":"p25s1","text":"1. Make sure the `dsh` command is available.\n2. Install by package name (npm — recommended):"},{"id":"p26s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p27s1","text":"Or install directly from a GitHub release tarball:"},{"id":"p28s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p29s1","text":"## Install from source (clone)"},{"id":"p30s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p31s1","text":"Then attach it as a bundle to a DSH profile:"},{"id":"p32s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p33s1","text":"> `dsh plugin add` installs the package into the profile and, thanks to its `dsh.bundle` declaration"},{"id":"p33s2","text":", **automatically hooks it into the bundle stack** — no manual config needed.\n> Refresh / restart DS"},{"id":"p33s3","text":"H Web for the theme to take effect."},{"id":"p34s1","text":"## Usage & configuration"},{"id":"p35s1","text":"- Open DSH Web → **Settings → Xiao Theme**: master toggle, accent color, **voice (work sessions)**, "},{"id":"p35s2","text":"template language, custom prompt, **roleplay space (entertainment)**, avatar path, mascot title/subt"},{"id":"p35s3","text":"itle, theme management, frosted background (on / path / upload / blur / opacity; GIF or MP4/WebM/MOV"},{"id":"p35s4","text":"/M4V video auto-detected as a dynamic background, with a sound toggle and volume slider for video), "},{"id":"p35s5","text":"UI opacity, sidebar opacity, settings page opacity.\n[该节后续省略]"},{"id":"p36s1","text":"## Notes"},{"id":"p37s1","text":"[该节后续省略]"},{"id":"p38s1","text":"## License & disclaimers"},{"id":"p39s1","text":"- **Code**: this repository's source is open-source under the **MIT license** (see `LICENSE`); study"},{"id":"p39s2","text":", modify, and redistribute as permitted.\n[该节后续省略]"}],"truncated":true}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}
